     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "No matter the differences in thought between Eastern and Western cultures, both groups believe that in many cases, the ways in which we get to “the end” and the rules we follow along the way all have bearing on how we achieve our goal. They both believe that those engaged in business are required to act with accountability and responsibility to both customers and employees alike."
    }
